# WH-1000XM5 Noise Control Mode and Ambient Level sets on real hardware:
# firmware 2.5.1, macOS, 2026-10-11. Captured by the frame log, driving the core
# directly. Attach reads Noise Cancelling, Focus on Voice off, level 10. Then,
# about 1.5 s apart, the app sets Off, Noise Cancelling, Ambient, level 15, 20,
# 1, 10 and Noise Cancelling again. The Device ACKs each set, then confirms it
# with an NCASM_NTFY_PARAM (0x69) echoing the set. Unrequested c9 frames
# ("unitRemove", "mpChgA2dp", "unitWear") come during Attach, one between the
# model name GET and its ACK. Battery 56 %.
